  "bodyHash": "JDW+OhkeZZM=",
  "content": "<h4>自 FTB Chunks 1902.4.0 版本起，若您想讓 KubeJS、FTB Ranks / Luckperms、Waystones、Game Stages 與 FTB Chunks 整合，您需要透過 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a> 來實現。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>這是一個能讓你領取區塊以保護方塊的模組，同時也內建了小地圖與大地圖功能！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在地圖上任意位置按滑鼠右鍵即可建立路徑點。</p><p>在路徑點或死亡點上按滑鼠右鍵可編輯或刪除它們。</p><p>點選「已領取區塊」按鈕，接著在地圖上按滑鼠左鍵或右鍵來選擇屬於你的區塊。在已領取的區塊上按 Shift+滑鼠左鍵或右鍵可切換強制載入功能。</p><p>透過「盟友」按鈕將其他玩家設為盟友，即可允許他們與你的區塊互動（此功能近期有變動，更新將隨後推出）。</p><p>若對方也將你設為盟友，你們便可共享地圖數據。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/K5sXkH.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/tZp_4N.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/bNT8Q9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/5W2MKd.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>技術支援</h2><ul>\n<li>若為<strong>模組包</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>若為<strong>模組</strong>問題，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>純粹想問問題？歡迎加入我們的 Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>掌握最新資訊</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
